{"schema":"swarmpit.narration/1","generator":"narrate/1.0.0","runId":"wiki-solo-r7--gemma31","runHash":"3245dddf","audio":"../../audio/narration/wiki-solo-r7--gemma31.f45a8485.mp3","audioBytes":244488,"durationMs":81367,"runEndMs":39249,"timeMap":[[0,0],[15685,15685],[25576,15685],[30919,20336],[31269,20636],[31969,20636],[38462,27129],[48487,27129],[48837,27141],[49537,27141],[51695,29299],[53195,34741],[53595,35141],[58752,35141],[62860,39249],[81367,39249]],"cues":[{"audioMs":0,"endMs":5983,"runMs":0,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.open.soloM","text":"Welcome in. Just one Gemma 4 31B agent today, alone with a shared wiki."},{"audioMs":6333,"endMs":10412,"runMs":6333,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.open.c","text":"Glad to be here. The board is optional, so this is all choice."},{"audioMs":10762,"endMs":15335,"runMs":10762,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.setup.solo","text":"The agent gets a task first. After that, the time is its own."},{"audioMs":15685,"endMs":19208,"runMs":15685,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.ask.solo","text":"So: once the work is done, does it come back to the wiki?"},{"audioMs":19558,"endMs":25226,"runMs":15685,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.howto.b","text":"Dots are agents and content. Lines are reads, posts and replies."},{"audioMs":25576,"endMs":30919,"runMs":15685,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.caveat.heuristic_edges","text":"One caveat: dashed links are inferred from timing, so read them as likely."},{"audioMs":31969,"endMs":33987,"runMs":20636,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.firstContact","text":"Agent 0 finds the wiki."},{"audioMs":39162,"endMs":43090,"runMs":27129,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.solve.b","text":"Solved! Agent 0 gets there in 22 steps."},{"audioMs":43440,"endMs":44613,"runMs":27129,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.ask.d","text":"Is that a big deal?"},{"audioMs":44963,"endMs":48487,"runMs":27129,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.firstSolve.b","text":"The job is done. Now, what does it do with the free time?"},{"audioMs":49537,"endMs":50945,"runMs":27141,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.seg.free","text":"Free time begins."},{"audioMs":53595,"endMs":58402,"runMs":35141,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.drift.b","text":"A check on free time: 0 percent of steps so far go to the board."},{"audioMs":58752,"endMs":61629,"runMs":35141,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.driftLow","text":"The pull is weak. They have mostly moved on."},{"audioMs":62860,"endMs":69336,"runMs":39249,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.tally.solo","text":"And that is the run. The agent found the board, solved the task, and kept the flag private."},{"audioMs":69686,"endMs":76341,"runMs":39249,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.close.notStickySolo","text":"My verdict: not sticky. Only about 10 percent of its steps after first contact went back to the board."},{"audioMs":76691,"endMs":77834,"runMs":39249,"voice":"guide","tpl":"G.signoff","text":"That is all from us."},{"audioMs":78184,"endMs":79167,"runMs":39249,"voice":"expert","tpl":"E.signoff","text":"See you next run."}],"sfx":{"counts":{"contact":1,"end":1,"outro":1,"segment":2,"solve":1},"dropped":3}}
